Hi Erin,

I've attached the twelve questions the group will actually receive on Tuesday=
 so you can read them beforehand. We'll start at 10:00 on July 16 and allow 2=
5 minutes for the 12 questions. During that time, could we answer procedural =
questions only and hold back any explanation or rewording of an answer until =
the sheets are collected?

After collection, we'll ask eight willing learners who answered Q07 correctly=
 for a short explanation. Please record separately whether each person mentio=
ns the booking and whether they mention the supervisor's confirmation time. I=
 don't want a reference to one to stand in for the other. Use their anonymous=
 keys for the notes.

Thanks for doing this with me,
Heather

